WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.968
Meet Maya. She's looking for a CGM nearby.

00:00:05.418 --> 00:00:10.146
Meanwhile, Jordan has an unopened CGM he can offer.

00:00:10.596 --> 00:00:16.356
Maya adds what she needs and a city or ZIP. No street address.

00:00:16.806 --> 00:00:22.206
A possible match appears. Maya asks Jordan to connect.

00:00:22.656 --> 00:00:29.304
Jordan takes a moment to review. Maya's contact stays private while he decides.

00:00:29.754 --> 00:00:34.962
He approves. Now they can talk it through and decide together.
